Copyright 1986-1993 The Regents of the University of California

Licence: BSD-4-clause (with clause 3 deleted -- see below), as recorded in Debian's
debian/copyright for the fortune-mod source package. A verbatim copy of that file is
alongside this one as debian-copyright.txt.

Note that clause 3, the "advertising clause", was formally rescinded by the University
of California in 1999:

    ftp://ftp.cs.berkeley.edu/pub/4bsd/README.Impt.License.Change

With clause 3 removed this is effectively the 3-clause BSD licence, which is compatible
with the GNU GPL. That is what allows this data to be distributed alongside Cowsaver's
GPLv3 source without either licence being violated or the data being relicensed.

